---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] mt-20 sm:mt-24">
  <div class="container-page py-10 sm:py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-10 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0" />
              <path d="M5 12.86a10 10 0 0 1 14 0" />
              <path d="M8.5 16.43a5 5 0 0 1 7 0" />
              <circle cx="12" cy="20" r="1.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span>Agent Cast</span>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          HarmonyOS 原生「桌面 Agent 遥控器」。一个 App 管 Hermes / OpenCode / OpenClaw,手机即遥控器。
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[var(--color-text-subtle)]">
          数据全本地,无云端服务,无追踪。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold">产品</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          <li><a href="/guide" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">使用指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide#download" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">下载</a></li>
          <li><a href="/changelog" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">更新日志</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold">资源</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/atbeta/agent-cast" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">GitHub 仓库</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">隐私政策</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/atbeta/agent-cast/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[var(--color-text)]">反馈问题</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-6 text-xs text-[var(--color-text-subtle)] sm:mt-12 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-3">
      <p>© {year} Beta · Agent Cast · Made with care for HarmonyOS</p>
      <p class="font-mono">v1.0.0 · HarmonyOS 5.0+ (API 12+)</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>